{
  "titre": "How an air conditioner really works",
  "ligne": "meca",
  "langue_source": "en",
  "script": {
    "titre": "Your AC has never made cold",
    "accroche": "So where does the *heat* go?",
    "description": "Your air conditioner never creates cold: it moves your room's heat outside, with one fluid, a compressor and a valve smaller than your thumb. What should we open up next?",
    "commentaire": "What machine should we open up next?",
    "hashtags": [
      "#howitworks",
      "#engineering",
      "#airconditioner",
      "#physics",
      "#3danimation"
    ],
    "beats": [
      {
        "role": "accroche",
        "voix": "Your AC has never made *a single degree* of cold.",
        "image": "gros plan sur le serpentin glacé qui fume, la caméra recule et révèle toute la clim"
      },
      {
        "role": "enjeu",
        "voix": "It *steals heat* from your room and dumps it *outside*.",
        "image": "l'air tiède de la pièce entre, l'air chaud sort dehors"
      },
      {
        "role": "boucle",
        "voix": "And the whole trick hides in a part *smaller than your thumb*.",
        "image": "la caméra plonge vers une petite pièce en laiton qui pulse, sans la nommer"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "It all runs on one fluid, the *refrigerant*, looping through these pipes.",
        "image": "seuls les tuyaux restent, le fluide lumineux fait toute la boucle"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "First, the *compressor* squeezes that gas tighter than a *rush-hour subway*.",
        "image": "gros plan sur le compresseur transparent, ses spirales qui tournent"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "Squeezed gas gets *hot*. Around *eighty degrees*.",
        "ecran": "80°C",
        "image": "le gaz qui sort du compresseur devient rouge vif"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "That hot gas rushes into the *outdoor coil*.",
        "image": "la caméra monte le long du serpentin extérieur qui s'allume"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "A fan blasts air through the fins and *rips the heat out*.",
        "image": "le ventilateur accélère, l'air chaud jaillit"
      },
      {
        "role": "relance",
        "voix": "Now here's the *wild* part: the gas turns back into a *liquid*.",
        "image": "secousse, la caméra plonge sur le tuyau qui devient liquide"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "Still warm, and squeezed to *ten times* your car tire's pressure.",
        "ecran": "x10",
        "image": "le liquide sous pression avance vers la petite pièce"
      },
      {
        "role": "gain",
        "voix": "Then, the tiny part: the *expansion valve*. The pressure *collapses*.",
        "image": "gros plan sur la vanne de détente qui s'allume, secousse quand la pression tombe"
      },
      {
        "role": "gain",
        "voix": "At low pressure, it *boils* at just *five degrees*.",
        "ecran": "5°C",
        "image": "le fluide devient une brume bleue glacée"
      },
      {
        "role": "gain",
        "voix": "And boiling *drinks heat*. That's where your cold really comes from.",
        "image": "la caméra plonge dans le serpentin intérieur glacé"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "Your room's warm air crosses this *icy coil* and comes out *chilled*.",
        "image": "l'air tiède entre dans l'unité intérieure et ressort bleu"
      },
      {
        "role": "mecanisme",
        "voix": "The gas, now loaded with *your heat*, races back to the compressor.",
        "image": "on suit le retour du gaz jusqu'au compresseur"
      },
      {
        "role": "fin",
        "voix": "That hot breeze outside is *your room's heat*. Your AC never made cold.",
        "image": "retour sur la vue du début, l'air chaud souffle dehors"
      }
    ],
    "boucles": [
      {
        "annonce": 3,
        "paiement": 11,
        "promesse": "la pièce plus petite que le pouce"
      },
      {
        "annonce": 2,
        "paiement": 16,
        "promesse": "où part la chaleur"
      }
    ]
  },
